003cbr\u003e✔ Prevăzută cu două tulpini pentru un aspect mai bogat și mai natural\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTip produs: Plantă decorativă artificială\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel: \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBananier\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCuloare: Verde\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eÎnălțime: 160 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUtilizare: Interior\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-10T13:18:10+03:00","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:04:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plante Artificiale Interioare","tags":["active","All Stock","Plante artificiale","Plante Artificiale Interioare"],"variants":[{"id":53228627198219,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-PL1D-BJ106","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"239.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"239.99","position":1,"product_id":10998753329419,"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:04:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69717539815691,"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:29:49+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:37:29+03:00","product_id":10998753329419,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Banana_plant_160_cm_Verde_1.png?v=1783517849","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69717576777995,"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:36:59+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:37:43+03:00","product_id":10998753329419,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Banana_plant_160_cm_Verde_2.png?v=1783517863","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69717565604107,"created_at":"2026-07-08T16:34:18+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-08T16:37:58+03:00","product_id":10998753329419,"va