astic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interior\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAvantaje\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAspect foarte realist, cu frunze bogate și textură naturală.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNu necesită udare, fertilizare sau lumină solară.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eÎși păstrează culoarea și forma pe termen lung.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSoluție decorativă elegantă pentru orice tip de amenajare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eConținut pachet\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 × Palmier Kentia artificial, 160 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 × Ghiveci din plastic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pentru un aspect cât mai natural, frunzele pot fi modelate și aranjate după despachetare.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-09T10:50:52+03:00","created_at":"2026-07-09T10:40:46+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plante Artificiale Interioare","tags":["active","All Stock","Plante artificiale","Plante Artificiale Interioare"],"variants":[{"id":53230649344267,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-PL1D-TZK17106","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"259.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"259.99","position":1,"product_id":10999415636235,"created_at":"2026-07-09T10:40:47+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69720938283275,"created_at":"2026-07-09T10:46:09+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-09T10:47:45+03:00","product_id":10999415636235,"variant_ids":[],"src":"http