ia_220_cm_Verde_1.png?v=1783597312","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69722072940811,"created_at":"2026-07-09T14:39:07+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-09T14:42:02+03:00","product_id":10999488905483,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Roystonea_Regia_220_cm_Verde_2.png?v=1783597322","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69722083393803,"created_at":"2026-07-09T14:41:19+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-09T14:42:13+03:00","product_id":10999488905483,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Roystonea_Regia_220_cm_Verde_3.png?v=1783597333","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69722016841995,"created_at":"2026-07-09T14:30:20+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-09T14:42:26+03:00","product_id":10999488905483,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Roystonea_Regia_220_cm_Verde_4.png?v=1783597346","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69722033553675,"created_at":"2026-07-09T14:34:24+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-07-09T14:42:37+03:00","product_id":10999488905483,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Decora_iune_Roystonea_Regia_220_cm_Verde_5.png?v=1783597357","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10998510911755,"title":"Planta Artificială Copac Tip Ficus, 2 Ramuri, 67 cm, Verde, cu Ghiveci","handle":"copac-artificial-ficus-ramificatie-2-ramuri-100-cm-verde","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eTransformă orice încăpere într-un spațiu elegant și primitor cu acest \u003cstrong\u003eFicus Lyrata artificial de 67 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e, cunoscut și sub denumirea de \u003cem\u003eFiddle Leaf Fig\u003c\/em\u003e. Cu un aspect realist, frunze mari în nuanțe naturale de verde și un trunchi atent finisat, planta reprezintă alegerea ideală pentru decorarea locuințelor, birourilor, hotelurilor, restaurantelor sau spațiilor comerciale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRealizat din materiale premium, ficusul își păstrează aspectul proaspăt pe termen lung, fără a necesita udare, lumină naturală sau întreținere. Designul său modern completează perfect orice stil de amenajare, de la minimalist și contemporan până la clasic.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCaracteristici\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTip produs:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plantă artificială decorativă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecie:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ficus Lyrata (Fiddle Leaf Fig)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eÎnălțime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 67 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCuloare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Verde natural\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial frunze:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plastic premium cu aspect realist\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial trunchi:\u003c\/strong\u003e PP\/PE cu finisaj ce imită lemnul natural\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGhiveci inclus:\u003c\/strong\u003e Da, ghiveci din plastic negru\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interior\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAvantaje\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAspect foarte realist, cu frunze bogate și textură naturală.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNu necesită udare, fertilizare sau lumină solară.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eÎși păstrează culoarea și forma pe termen lung.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal pentru living, dormitor, birou, recepție, hotel, restaurant sau showroom.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSoluție decorativă elegantă pentru orice tip de amenajare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eConținut pachet\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 × Ficus Lyrata artificial, 67 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 × Ghiveci din plastic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pentru un aspect cât mai natural, frunzele pot fi modelate și aranjate după despachetare.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-08T14:12:20+03:00","created_at":"2026-07-08T13:57:41+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plante Artificiale Interioare","tags":["active","All Stock","Plante artificiale","Plante Artificiale Interioare"],"variants":[{"id":53227874582795,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-PL1D-QYR2100","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"95.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"95.99","position":1,"product_id":10998510911755,"created_at":"2026-07-08T13:57:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:33+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":70004151615755,"created_at":"2026-08-27T12:17:28+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-27T12:24:24+03:00","product_id":10998510911755,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Planta_Artificial_Copac_Tip_Ficus_2_Ramuri_67_cm_Verde_cu_Ghiveci_1.png?v=1787822664","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":70004163215627,"created_at":"2026-08-27T12:23:54+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-27T12:24:42+03:00","product_id":10998510911755,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Planta_Artificial_Copac_Tip_Ficus_2_Ramuri_67_cm_Verde_cu_Ghiveci_2.png?v=1787822682","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":70004160102667,"cre